 to  mention it this attention is not exactly  a type of attention that you want sure  it might be cool amongst your friends  and family and business acquaintances  who will be impressed and happy for you  but whipping out such a card at walmart  is likely not the best idea so just make  sure you're getting the card for the  right reasons but that's just what i  think would you guys get us in touring  card comment that down below  also drop a like if you're a fan of  using credit cards the right way and of  course consider checking out our discord  community to suggest future video ideas  and consider subscribing and see more  questions logically answered but until  then i'm hari and i'll see you guys on  the next one  [Music]

